Package: janusbootctl
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: JanusBoot Maintainers <janusboot@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-tk, python3-pil, python3-jsonschema
Description: JanusBoot ESP settings CLI and Linux GUI
 janusbootctl validates and edits the JanusBoot ESP settings/theme contract
 and launches a Tk desktop GUI. Install on Linux guests for OS-side
 configuration; EFI boot itself uses Limine + ESP assets (QEMU smoke separate).
